></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">須</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>必须；务必；必然</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ス・シュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すべから.く・すべし・ひげ・まつ・もち.いる・もと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">偏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>偏颇；偏袒；倾斜；一侧；偏旁</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かたよ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偏</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">左偏旁；偏旁（字的左部分）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偏る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたよる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倾斜；倾向一侧；不均衡；偏重；集中；偏心；有偏见；带有成见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">偏見</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へんけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">偏见；偏差；歪曲的看法</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">雰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>气氛；雾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雰囲気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">气氛；氛围；环境；感觉；某种气质；气息；特殊的感觉；大气；地球大气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">遇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>遇见；遭遇；接待；对待；会见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">グウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">境遇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうぐう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">境遇；处境；生活状况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">待遇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいぐう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">待遇；接待；服务；工作条件；薪酬；工资；报酬</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">諮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>咨询；商议</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">諮る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はかる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">商议；咨询；协商；商量</span></li></ul></div></li>"]